+# Native DirPlayer readiness report
+
+## Outcome
+
+The isolated readiness branch is a safe starting point for bounded, single-session
+native Director work. It proves the current local-load/startup/CPU-capture route
+and stabilizes the timer/browser baseline. It does not complete the native
+backend, multi-session ownership, Flash, audio, Bevy, or product integration.
+
+The original dirty checkout remains the source of unrelated work. This report's
+receipts belong to `/private/tmp/dirplayer-native-readiness-cumulative-20260918`
+only.
+
+## Source boundary and receipts
+
+The isolated worktree is branch `codex/native-dirplayer-readiness`.
+
+| Scope | Source | Evidence |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Combined cumulative baseline and BrowserOwner/timer reconciliation | `7cd3cc78eef4e5745472e41207690f6ce0874c9c` | `731b0d0a6080b548d8dc0bf87a88b40c4efaf144` |
+| Owner-bound timer stabilization | `fff7dcc3804d857c0bc1b48570399bcea7cee5c8` | `a4aa876d26ecf535972912c28d26b09efcaa32c8` |
+| Final native probe source | `1a99d618df29da6a1bf915aee826a3a8e9dcb7be` | `3675f526416eb31852a1d716d9a837d9329a1328` |
+
